{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"agent_message","text":"The first prototype compiles cleanly and computes exact gradients, but 12.7 ms/step is too slow for 20k steps. I’m profiling cheaper expectation paths (wavefunction-first, Pauli-string APIs, and contraction settings) to bring per-step time down."}}
